{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>I am dying, and Elohim will surely remember you</b> — meaning: I today am here, and tomorrow in the grave; but the Holy One, blessed be He, is a living and enduring King — He will remember you. And the doubled פקד / פקד hints: just as I ruled 80 years, so a redeemer who is eighty years old will come to you. Alternatively, יפקוד in the sense of deficiency, as in 'and not one was missing from us.' A hint: from פקוד (defective) subtract ת' ק'ץ years, and 210 remain."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:52.750013704Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}